Read `gravity/job.md`, `gravity/domain.md`, `gravity/invariants.md`, `gravity/boundaries.md` and `gravity/grammar.md` before writing or changing code.
Use only the canonical names in `gravity/domain.md`. When a decision is not covered there, stop and ask, then record the answer in the right file.
Specs live in `/specs/`, one per change, dated. After a change lands, write back to `gravity/` what the work decided.
